      "uz_compare": "O'zbek tilida bunday qoida yo'q — shuning uchun yodlash kerak. Yaxshi xabar: deyarli barcha ㅂ bilan tugaydigan sifatlar bir xil o'zgaradi: 춥다 → 추워요, 덥다 → 더워요.",
      "compare_en": "There's no rule like this in English, so learn it as a pattern. The good news: almost every adjective ending in ㅂ changes the same way: 춥다 → 추워요, 덥다 → 더워요."
