      "meaning_uz": "...aylikmi? ...amizmi?: taklif",
      "meaning_en": "Shall we …?: suggesting",
      "explanation_md": "**-(으)ㄹ까요?** — birgalikda nimadir qilishni taklif qilish: \"...aylikmi?\", \"...amizmi?\".\n\n**같이 산책할까요?** — *Birga sayr qilamizmi?*\n\n### Qanday yasaladi\n\n- O'zak **받침siz** → **-ㄹ까요?**: 가다 → **갈까요?**, 보다 → **볼까요?**\n- O'zak **받침 bilan** → **-을까요?**: 먹다 → **먹을까요?**, 앉다 → **앉을까요?**\n- O'zak **ㄹ bilan** → **-까요?**: 놀다 → **놀까요?**, 만들다 → **만들까요?**\n\n### Javob berish\n\n- **네, 좋아요.** — *Ha, mayli.*\n- **네, 같이 가요.** — *Ha, birga boraylik.*\n- **미안해요. 오늘은 시간이 없어요.** — *Kechirasiz, bugun vaqtim yo'q.*\n\n### Esda tuting\n\n- **뭐 먹을까요?** — *Nima yeymiz?*; **어디에 갈까요?** — *Qayerga boramiz?*\n- Bu shakl so'roq; javobda **-(으)ㄹ까요** takrorlanmaydi.",
      "explanation_md_en": "**-(으)ㄹ까요?** suggests doing something together: \"Shall we …?\".\n\n**같이 산책할까요?** — *Shall we take a walk together?*\n\n### How to form it\n\n- Stem **without 받침** → **-ㄹ까요?**: 가다 → **갈까요?**, 보다 → **볼까요?**\n- Stem **with 받침** → **-을까요?**: 먹다 → **먹을까요?**, 앉다 → **앉을까요?**\n- Stem **ending in ㄹ** → **-까요?**: 놀다 → **놀까요?**, 만들다 → **만들까요?**\n\n### Answering\n\n- **네, 좋아요.** — *Yes, sounds good.*\n- **네, 같이 가요.** — *Yes, let's go.*\n- **미안해요. 오늘은 시간이 없어요.** — *Sorry, I don't have time today.*\n\n### Remember\n\n- **뭐 먹을까요?** — *What shall we eat?*; **어디에 갈까요?** — *Where shall we go?*\n- It's a question; the answer doesn't repeat **-(으)ㄹ까요**.",
      "formation": [
        {
          "condition_uz": "받침 yo'q",
          "condition_en": "No 받침",
          "rule": "V + ㄹ까요?",
          "example": "가다 → 갈까요?, 보다 → 볼까요?"
        },
        {
          "condition_uz": "받침 bor",
          "condition_en": "With 받침",
          "rule": "V + 을까요?",
          "example": "먹다 → 먹을까요?, 앉다 → 앉을까요?"
        },
        {
          "condition_uz": "ㄹ bilan",
          "condition_en": "Ends in ㄹ",
          "rule": "V + 까요?",
          "example": "놀다 → 놀까요?"
        }
      ],
      "examples": [
        {
